I see that the leaves in the backyard still haven't been raked.

3
00:00:04,707 --> 00:00:07,080
Weren't you planning to do that?

4
00:00:07,080 --> 00:00:07,130
Man:

5
00:00:07,130 --> 00:00:11,270
