6
00:00:11,270 --> 00:00:11,677
Woman:

7
00:00:11,677 --> 00:00:14,120
Well, it's supposed to rain tomorrow.

8
00:00:14,120 --> 00:00:18,070
It might be your last chance before everything gets soggy.

9
00:00:18,070 --> 00:00:18,330
Man:

10
00:00:18,330 --> 00:00:18,850
Good point.

11
00:00:18,850 --> 00:00:20,150
